# Defensive: stale wrangler config that may be auto-generated when wrangler is
# accidentally run from the project root (it treats the Expo web build
# as a static-assets worker and overwrites our module worker). The
# real config lives in cloudflare-worker/wrangler.toml and IS tracked.
/wrangler.jsonc
